          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Customizable Ambient Sound with Real-Time Awareness",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The NEW Z22 Ambient IEM sets a new standard for in-ear monitors with its innovative, customizable sound experience. The revolutionary design eliminates the need for external packs - plug it straight into your standard wireless (belt)pack or audio interface/DJ controller/laptop, and you’re ready to go. Unlike others, we offer two user-changeable filters (-19dB and -31dB) with every Z22, giving you ambient control and bass adjustability for a truly tailored sound experience. What makes these filters truly unique is their ability to let you hear everything happening around you in real time. From the energy of the crowd to conversations in the booth, even subtle environmental sounds like the ambiance of the venue or the click of your gear, all come through naturally while keeping your hearing protected. You’ll stay connected to the vibe of the room, ensuring you never lose touch with the audience or your surroundings.<br/><br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_GCza3F": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Rich, Fatigue-Free Audio with Dual Magnetic Drivers",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>With patented dual magnetic dynamic drivers and a unique bi-directional pressure relief port, the Z22 delivers rich, balanced sound without ear fatigue. Our dual-port design and LDMD (Large Dual Magnetic Diaphragm) technology offer deep bass, clear mids, and natural, extended highs, all while preventing pneumatic pressure on your eardrums. This allows you to hear every detail of your set without compromising your ability to interact with the crowd, booth staff, or fellow DJs. Whether you’re transitioning tracks, planning your next drop, or syncing with live performers, this system ensures you maintain perfect awareness and control while staying fully immersed in your performance.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gJpnXe": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ergonomic Design for All-Day Comfort and Durability",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Comfort is king! The Z22’s award-winning ergonomic design fits most ears perfectly, making it the most comfortable universal model on the market. Each pair is handcrafted by expert technicians, ensuring quality that lasts for years.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
